"Project-Id-Version: RangedDamageXp\n"
"Language: zh_CN\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"

msgid "Ranged damage XP"
msgstr "远程伤害经验"

msgid "Experience"
msgstr "经验"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "The shooter also gets experience for the damage dealt."
msgstr "射手也会因造成的伤害获得经验。"

msgid "Experience per damage"
msgstr "每点伤害的经验"

msgid "Damage after armour. At 0.02 a hit of about 70 damage gives as much as a second of aiming."
msgstr "护甲后的伤害。数值为 0.02 时，约 70 点伤害的命中相当于瞄准一秒的经验。"

msgid "Limit per hit"
msgstr "每次命中上限"

msgid "0 - no limit."
msgstr "0 - 无上限。"

msgid "Minimum damage"
msgstr "最低伤害"

msgid "Weaker hits are not counted."
msgstr "低于此值的命中不计算。"

msgid "Share for Perception"
msgstr "知觉所占比例"

msgid "0 - Perception gets nothing."
msgstr "0 - 知觉不获得经验。"

msgid "Which hits count"
msgstr "计算哪些命中"

msgid "Turrets"
msgstr "炮塔"

msgid "Shots from a turret train the Turrets skill."
msgstr "炮塔射击会提升炮塔技能。"

msgid "Hits on allies"
msgstr "命中友军"

msgid "Hits on downed targets"
msgstr "命中倒地目标"

msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "诊断"

msgid "Detailed log"
msgstr "详细日志"

msgid "A line in RE_Kenshi_log.txt for every counted hit."
msgstr "每次计入的命中都会在 RE_Kenshi_log.txt 中记录一行。"

msgid "Shooters also get experience for the damage their shots deal."
msgstr "射手也会因射击造成的伤害获得经验。"

msgid "Experience for each point of damage that got through armour. At 0.02 a hit of about 70 damage gives as much as a second of aiming."
msgstr "每点穿透护甲的伤害获得的经验。数值为 0.02 时，约 70 点伤害的命中相当于瞄准一秒的经验。"

msgid "Caps the experience from one hit, so a lucky point-blank bolt does not give too much. 0 - no limit."
msgstr "限制单次命中获得的经验，避免一发近距离的幸运弩箭给出过多经验。0 - 无上限。"

msgid "Hits weaker than this are not counted - scratches on armour."
msgstr "低于此值的命中不计算 - 视为护甲上的擦伤。"

msgid "Part of the extra experience that goes to Perception. 0 - Perception gets nothing."
msgstr "额外经验中分给知觉的比例。0 - 知觉不获得经验。"

msgid "Give experience for hitting your own people too. Off by default, otherwise shooting allies would pay."
msgstr "命中自己人也给予经验。默认关闭，否则射击友军反而有利。"

msgid "Give experience for hitting targets lying unconscious."
msgstr "命中昏迷倒地的目标也给予经验。"

msgid "A line in RE_Kenshi_log.txt for every counted hit: who, whom, damage, experience, level before and after."
msgstr "每次计入的命中都会在 RE_Kenshi_log.txt 中记录一行：谁、命中谁、伤害、经验、前后等级。"
